&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager for Data Integrations, you&#39;ll help GitLab&#39;s analytics and artificial intelligence (AI) agents see beyond the data held in GitLab. You&#39;ll decide which external systems connect to the Data Insights Platform and Orbit, which integrations come first, and how their data fits into shared models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineering teams plan work, track incidents, monitor production, and manage security findings across different tools. Your challenge is to bring that context together with GitLab&#39;s code, merge requests, pipelines, deployments, and vulnerabilities. You&#39;ll shape a consistent approach that gives customers a trustworthy picture they can query, report on, and use with agents, rather than another set of disconnected data sources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Bangalore, India. You&#39;ll work from home and come to the Bangalore office when needed for business or team activities. You should be based in Bangalore or willing to relocate there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Set integration priorities using evidence from customers, field teams, and other product managers to identify the biggest gaps in context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Shape how external data maps into GitLab&#39;s shared data models, including the extract, transform, and load (ETL) approach and the transformations needed to make sources work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Define the customer problems and user groups each integration serves. Partner with engineering to agree on the intended experience, trade-offs, and delivery sequence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Translate product decisions into a clear backlog of epics and issues for engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Define telemetry and adoption signals to understand whether connected data helps customers answer new questions, and use those findings to guide priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Help shape integration pricing and packaging as the product area matures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Use AI coding agents and GitLab to explore data, prototype integrations, and document the intended experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Product management experience, with the ability to connect customer needs to priorities and make trade-offs with incomplete information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of the software development and operations (DevOps) ecosystem, including how planning, security, observability, and IT service management tools fit into engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;A working understanding of data integration, ETL, and data transformation, including how data from different systems maps to a common model. You don&#39;t need a background as a data engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Comfort using AI tools for prototyping and documentation as part of your product work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Clear communication about customer problems, close collaboration with engineering, and a habit of using data to evaluate adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Experience with integration products, data models, or value stream analytics is helpful, but isn&#39;t required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re part of GitLab&#39;s Core Data Products organization, which focuses on insights, analytics, and data-driven decision-making. You&#39;ll report to the Vice President of Product Management and join as our third product manager, focused on Data Integrations. You&#39;ll work alongside a Principal Product Manager responsible for the Data Insights Platform and dashboards, and a Product Manager focused on Orbit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is all-remote, with asynchronous collaboration across regions. Transparency, written communication, and clear decisions are central to how we work. This role has the Bangalore location and in-person requirements described above.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Grupo QuintoAndar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are Grupo QuintoAndar, the &lt;strong&gt;largest housing platform in Latin America&lt;/strong&gt;. Driven by our shared purpose of &lt;strong&gt;helping people love where they live&lt;/strong&gt;, we build technology and solutions that simplify the entire housing journey, from renting to buying and selling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Operating across &lt;strong&gt;6 countries&lt;/strong&gt; (Brazil, Mexico, Argentina, Peru, Ecuador, and Panama) and with a &lt;strong&gt;technology hub in Portugal&lt;/strong&gt;, we bring together more than 3,100 people united by the challenge of transforming the real estate industry. Backed by top global investors such as SoftBank, General Atlantic, and Kaszek, we have raised over &lt;strong&gt;US$ 755 million&lt;/strong&gt; and are valued at &lt;strong&gt;US$ 5.1 billion&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We lead market transformation as pioneers in large-scale Artificial Intelligence applications for the real estate sector. Our platforms welcome over 50 million monthly visits, managing more than 350,000 active rental contracts and processing R$ 20 billion in annual transaction value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you are looking to solve complex problems with autonomy, cutting-edge technology, and massive scale impact, &lt;strong&gt;come on in, the house is yours.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our story, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;owrQq&quot; href=&quot;https://grupoquintoandar.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grupoquintoandar.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Location &amp;amp; Work Model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We operate under a remote-first model, giving you full flexibility to work from anywhere in Brazil. For those who enjoy in-person moments, we offer access to our office in São Paulo and partner coworking spaces. In addition, we have the Work From Anywhere (WFA) program, which allows you to work remotely from anywhere in the world for up to 90 days a year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;About the Team &amp;amp; The Challenge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At QuintoAndar, Product Managers are at the core of our strategy, using technology and innovation to solve complex real-world problems and help people love where they live. We are looking for a highly analytical and strategic Senior Product Manager to lead high-impact workstreams and shape the future of our ecosystem. You will be responsible for driving the product vision, prioritizing big bets, and ensuring execution flows smoothly in a fast-paced, scale-up environment, directly impacting our transition into an AI-First company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape and execute the product vision and quarterly roadmap, translating complex business and user problems into scalable product solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead a cross-functional squad—integrating engineering, design, data, and operations—to ensure seamless execution and high-quality deliveries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep dive into execution and data, kicking off discovery streams, validating hypotheses, and testing new approaches before scaling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence business strategy and coordinate cross-company initiatives, managing complex stakeholder relationships and aligning expectations with senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a role model for product excellence, bringing market insights, raising the bar for decision-making, and occasionally coaching more junior product team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid product track record: proven experience as a Product Manager designing, building, and delivering high-impact, end-to-end digital solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills: you are data-driven, comfortable navigating complex metrics, and capable of taking bold decisions based on factual data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional stakeholder management: demonstrated ability to gather inputs, handle pushbacks, and influence cross-functional teams and senior leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;User-centric mindset: ability to uncover real user requirements (even the unarticulated ones) and advocate for the best experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast-pace resilience: comfortable working with aggressive timelines and making quick adjustments in a fast-changing, high-growth environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous background in highly analytical positions, such as strategy consulting, data science, or operations, combined with hands-on product experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working on complex marketplaces, platform foundations, or AI-centric products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced or fluent English skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What Is Our Selection Process Like?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We designed a transparent and straightforward journey focused on evaluating your technical and behavioral potential, while giving you the opportunity to get to know our teams and career paths:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application and Profile Review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with People Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case Study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring Manager Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer &amp;amp; Welcome!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Important:&lt;/strong&gt; We review all applications individually and guarantee feedback for every candidate. All communication is conducted via email, so please make sure to allow emails from &lt;code&gt;@quintoandar.com.br&lt;/code&gt; in your inbox.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We offer a comprehensive package designed to support your health, well-being, family, and professional growth:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary, PLR (Annual Performance Bonus).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Well-Being:&lt;/strong&gt; Health Plan, Dental Plan, Life Insurance, Wellhub (Gympass), and &lt;em&gt;QuintoCare&lt;/em&gt; (free psychological, legal, social, and financial support).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality of Life:&lt;/strong&gt; Meal and Food Vouchers, Birthday Day Off, Mother&#39;s Day, and Father&#39;s Day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Home Office Allowance and the &lt;em&gt;Work From Anywhere&lt;/em&gt; (WFA) program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family &amp;amp; Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Childcare Allowance, Atypical Parenting Allowance, Extended Parental Leave, and Kit Leiturinha (children&#39;s book club).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Career:&lt;/strong&gt; Partnerships and discounts with educational institutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Grupo QuintoAndar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We value &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt; and want &lt;strong&gt;everyone to feel welcome here&lt;/strong&gt;, regardless of their age, gender identity, sexual orientation, race, color, ethnicity, origin, disability, religion, or any other characteristic. All our job openings are open to all individuals!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll notice there are some diversity questions in the application form. For affirmative action roles, this information may be used to verify your alignment with the target audience for the opportunity. In such cases, it may be used for elimination purposes. For non-affirmative action roles, this data will be used anonymously, exclusively to monitor and improve our inclusion practices in the hiring process, and will have no impact on your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Privacy and Data Protection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Grupo QuintoAndar operates in compliance with privacy and data protection laws, including, but not limited to, the Brazilian General Personal Data Protection Law (LGPD) (Law No. 13,709/2018), and ensures the security of your data. To learn more, please access our&lt;a href=&quot;https://carreiras.quintoandar.com.br/aviso-de-privacidade-para-pessoas-candidatas/?lang=en&quot;&gt; Privacy Notice for Candidates&lt;/a&gt;. For questions or to exercise your rights as a data subject, please contact us through our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognitoforms.com/QuintoAndarcom/LeiGeralDeProte%C3%A7%C3%A3oDeDadosPessoaisLGPD&quot;&gt; Service Channel&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
